# Claude Code
# The project rules in .claude/settings.json and .claude/hooks/ are versioned so every clone gets
# them. Per-developer permission grants are not.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Terraform working state.
#
# `.terraform/` is vendored provider binaries and `*.tfstate` is the record of what exists in a
# real account — the second is the more important exclusion, since a state file carries resource
# identifiers, endpoints and generated passwords in plaintext. Remote state in S3 is where it
# belongs; a copy in git is a credential leak with version history.
#
# `.terraform.lock.hcl` is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins provider versions by checksum, which
# is the same reproducibility argument that made every base image digest-pinned and every npm
# dependency exact.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
